flowchart LR
  subgraph A[离线数据层]
    A1[原始社交数据<br/>user/post 表<br/>内容观测 Excel]
    A2[用户画像生成<br/>统计特征 + 证据帖<br/>五阶段 LLM 流水线]
    A3[portraits/*.json<br/>influence_tier<br/>profile_mode]
    A1 --> A2 --> A3
  end
  subgraph B[离线校准层]
    B1[语义处理与种群合成<br/>Kernel PCA 立场轴<br/>Rogers 分层扩量]
    B2[向量化 ABM + EM/Optuna<br/>四维推荐权重<br/>decay_lambda]
    B3[calibration_profile.yaml<br/>单一配置中枢]
    B1 --> B2 --> B3
  end
  subgraph C[在线运行层]
    C1[main.py 双进程启动<br/>Backend + Agent]
    C2[SocialRecSys.configure()<br/>注入校准参数<br/>Feed 排序]
    C3[Agent 模拟运行<br/>发帖/评论/点赞/转发<br/>记忆与时间推进]
    C4[runs/&lt;ID&gt; 运行归档<br/>指标评估与消融实验]
    C1 --> C2 --> C3 --> C4
  end
  A3 --> B1
  B3 --> C1
  C4 -.误差分析 / 下一轮校准.-> B2
  classDef data fill:#dae8fc,stroke:#6c8ebf,stroke-width:2px,color:#222;
  classDef cal fill:#ffe6cc,stroke:#d79b00,stroke-width:2px,color:#222;
  classDef run fill:#d5e8d4,stroke:#82b366,stroke-width:2px,color:#222;
  classDef center fill:#e1d5e7,stroke:#9673a6,stroke-width:2px,color:#222;
  class A1,A2 data; class A3,B3 center; class B1,B2 cal; class C1,C2,C3 run; class C4 center;
